{"id":"n41481-1-9","stage":3,"title":"깨물다 · 咬","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41481-1-9-1","ko":"사과가 참 맛있다.","zh":"苹果真好吃啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사과가","meaning":"苹果","explanation":"사과：苹果；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사과","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66371","senseId":"1","lemma":"사과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있다.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"46fc35121d1a4b33","term":"사과","zh":"苹果","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3","entryId":"66371","definition":"圆而红、味道酸甜的水果。","pronunciation":["사과"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9bc3cf302ffc11e2ec14.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41481-1-9-2","ko":"그렇지? 아까 나도 한 개 골라서 깨물어 먹어 봤는데 맛있더라.","zh":"对吧？我刚才也选了一个咬了一口，确实很好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇지?","meaning":"是呀，就是","explanation":"그렇지：是呀，就是","readings":[{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26031","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[